  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NEPAD-FAO Fish Programme (NFFP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NEPAD-FAO Fiskeprogram (NFFP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med FAOs regionala program f&#xf6;r fiske och akvakultur i Afrika    2010-2014 &#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra resultatbaserade insatser inom FAOs        mandatomr&#xe5;den - prioriterade av FAOs medlemsl&#xe4;nder och Afrikanska     Unionen/Regionala Ekonomiska Organisationer (RECs) - och i enlighet   med Parisagendan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of FAOs regional programme for fisheries and            aquaculture in Africa 2010-2014 is to implement result-based          interventions within the mandate areas of FAO - prioritized by the    IMO member states and the African Union/Regional Economic Communities (RECs) - and in accordance with the Paris declaration.</narrative>
  </description>
